{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blanky is a 2D platformer that combines fluid movement with fast thinking to avoid environmental hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870300/extras/5a8ae6c4da1cf644b8ae679b5dd947f3.poster.avif?t=1753287840\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870300/extras/5a8ae6c4da1cf644b8ae679b5dd947f3.webm?t=1753287840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870300/extras/5a8ae6c4da1cf644b8ae679b5dd947f3.mp4?t=1753287840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Using multiple abilities discovered along the way, Jacob travels through nightmarish areas each with their own distinct dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870300/extras/e12640f1908a3aeceba040bf9065c111.poster.avif?t=1753287840\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870300/extras/e12640f1908a3aeceba040bf9065c111.webm?t=1753287840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870300/extras/e12640f1908a3aeceba040bf9065c111.mp4?t=1753287840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring epic boss battles, heart pounding chases and a compelling story, Blanky is a challenging platforming adventure that explores fear from a child's point of view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3870300?t=1753287840","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepag